  "sentences": [
   "The bill would raise tax on excess after-tax superannuation contributions where a person exceeds their contribution cap and chooses not to release the excess and earnings.",
   "The rate would rise from 47 per cent to 47.5 per cent, combining the top marginal income tax rate with the proposed higher Medicare levy.",
   "It would accompany the proposed Medicare levy increase in a wider package intended to help fund the Commonwealth's contribution to the National Disability Insurance Scheme."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The new rate would apply to assessments for the 2019-20 financial year and later financial years.",
   "Commencement would align with the companion Medicare levy legislation.",
   "Section 5 of the excess non-concessional contributions tax Act would be updated."
  ],
  "affected": "Individuals liable for excess non-concessional contributions tax would be affected.",
